---
// Real numbers from iteration 1 of the evals (benchmark.json): 3 prompts, 1 run each, 22 checks.
---
<div class="score">
  <div class="nums">
    <div class="num">93%<small>checks passed with the skill</small></div>
    <div class="num without">79%<small>without it</small></div>
  </div>
  <p>Three test prompts, one run each, 22 checks covering real content, accessibility, and the looks AI keeps falling back to. A small test with real numbers, not a benchmark.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .score { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 8px 40px; align-items: end; margin: 72px 0 0; padding: 32px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .nums { display: flex; gap: 36px; align-items: baseline; }
  .num { font: 800 clamp(64px, 9vw, 120px)/.85 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .num small { display: block; font: 400 16px/1.3 var(--body); letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 10px; }
  .num.without { color: var(--muted); }
  p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) { .score { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .nums { gap: 24px; } }
</style>
